Z||000000||My7Fieros||10-03-2001||03:49 AM||||Ok heres a topic never brought up before..the over the roof Indy style scoop... (Yes Im being sarcastic). Anyway first off I somehow managed to find FieroMasters Quick IRM online catalogue. Last I heard IRM doesnt have a website and someone scanned their magazine or something and put it online. <BR>Anyway my question is does anybody have their phone number? Oreif....I know you got it somewhere!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <BR>Second, I came across <A HREF="http://www.showcars-bodyparts.com" TARGET=_blank>www.showcars-bodyparts.com</A>  and found one there to. I emailed them and they emailed me back within a couple of hours! They said they have them (they're making molds right now) and they cost 195.00 (which doesnt sound too bad at all). Thing is, it shows on their site for it to be for an 84, while IRMs has different scoops for the 84 and then the 85-87 notches. I dont know if showcars' scoop will work on my 86 SE...anybody know? TIA, <B><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="blue"><I>7</B></FONT></FONT></I><P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="blue"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I><p>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 10-03-2001).]||||reg||2
Z||000001||Haze_Performance||10-03-2001||05:27 AM||||Heres IRM's phone number. 301-948-3301<P>I believe that you'll have to do some trimming to the "showcars" one, to fit the hump. <P>I'm sticking with IRM. I called them a few times but there was no answer. I'm tring again today.<P><BR>P.S. The video is in the mail.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallindysig_copy.jpg">            .            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallredsig.jpg">      <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red">Classic Fiero Owners - <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> - Pennocks Wild Rides - <A HREF="http://clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 10-03-2001).]||||reg||14
